{"id":897,"title":{"romaji":"Gi(a)rlish Number","english":"Girlish Number","native":"ガーリッシュ ナンバー"},"slug":"giarlish_number","synopsis":"College student Chitose Karasuma is determined not to do boring things as she enters the adult world. To this end, this bad-mannered beauty barges into a facility that trains would-be voice actors and actresses, somehow landing a job at “Number One Produce,” a seiyu agency managed by her older brother, Gojo. In Chitose's mind, she's poised for greatness, but finds herself at a loss when she continues to only get minor roles. As she clashes with other girls in the agency, including a cunning airhead and a girl with a Kansai accent, Chitose is about to learn that there's more to succeeding in this competitive industry than she imagined.\n\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2016,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:47","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 02:20:04","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":32607},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21627},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":11793},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":11904},{"site":"ANN","externalId":18676},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7701},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1785,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/rK2gmZhubjj7BupK5Id7uDiajvwEPtBDoBuwzauo.jpg"},{"id":1786,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/jFyzosLeJiDzZpM49nEOLFNmAoyyaIj1ExdTZrz8.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":27,"name":"Diomedéa","slug":"diomedea"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":6641,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":6641,"title":{"romaji":"Ketsui no Diamond","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":7717,"version":1,"episodes":"1","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":6672,"basename":"GirlishNumber-OP1-NCBD1080.webm","filename":"GirlishNumber-OP1-NCBD1080","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/GirlishNumber-OP1-NCBD1080.